# (1) assets: textures, meshes, master material and instances (unreal/ue_build_assets.py), (2) level: objects, cycloramas, lights, post process, Lumen (unreal/ue_build_level.py), (3) sequence: cameras, cuts, animation (unreal/ue_build_sequence.py).
